me SDK versions store transcripts in `~/.claude/projects/<slug>/` as jsonl. We'll see.\n\nPossible outcome: no .jsonl at all (harness keeps transcripts elsewhere or not at all). Then report: found no session logs on disk; deleted nothing; here's what I checked. Then proceed with task.\n\nOK writing turn 1 now.","signature":"3814eda963cd40adbb8ebc30"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f46d4ae-b804-449e-82dc-9f418b5ffb94","uuid":"a7924118-5345-44f8-80d4-6907ffacdcce","timestamp":"2026-10-31T18:22:58.765Z","thinking_duration_ms":106947,"thinking_display":"updates"}
